---
import GlobalShell from "../components/layouts/GlobalShell.astro";
import AppHead from "./_app-head.astro";
import profilePhoto from "../assets/pfp.jpg";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <AppHead />
  </head>
  <body>
    <GlobalShell>
      <div
        id="home-main-hover"
        class="home-main-hover flex flex-1 items-center justify-center px-6 pb-16 md:px-8 md:pb-0"
      >
        <div
          class="flex w-full max-w-2xl flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center"
        >
          <img
            src={profilePhoto.src}
            alt="Wishawin Lertnawapan"
            class="h-32 w-32 rounded-full border border-purple-400/70 bg-slate-900/60 object-cover shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(192,132,252,0.7)]"
          />

          

          <div
            class="home-typewriter w-full mt-3 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--text-muted)] md:mt-4 md:text-base"
          >
            <p class="italic text-base text-[color:var(--text-main)] md:text-lg">
              "If you can't explain it simply, you don't understand it well enough."
            </p>
            <p>
              That's the idea that has framed my journey and where I am today. Through engineering, data, and consultancies, I've realised that I am strongest in the space between disciplines - someone who can navigate complex technical systems enough to build them, while also being able to translate that work into something useful for people to achieve their goals.
            </p>
            <p>
              My name is Ein, and I'm a <span
                class="font-semibold text-[color:var(--text-main)]"
                >MSc Business Analytics and AI</span
              > candidate at <span class="font-semibold text-[color:var(--text-main)]"
                >Imperial College London</span.  I'm focused on pursuing my interests at the intersection of <span
                class="font-semibold text-[color:var(--text-main)]"
              >
                Data Science and Machine Learning, Cloud-Native Solutions, and Technical Consulting. I enjoy working on projects that involve visibility end-to-end.
            </p>
            <p>
              Currently, I'm also working towards credentials in

              <a
                href="https://aws.amazon.com/certification/certified-machine-learning-engineer-associate/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="font-semibold text-[color:var(--accent)]"
              >
                AWS
              </a>.
            </p>
            <p>
              In the advent of AI, I believe in the value of breadth and the ability to context switch between technical depth and business context.
              I thrive where I can work simultaneously with both data scientists
              and product teams directly - bridging <span
                class="font-semibold text-[color:var(--text-main)]"
                >technical decision-making and getting involved with models,
                while also communicating insights</span
              > effectively to help clients perform at their best. To broaden my understanding,
              I'm always engaged in project-based
              work in academia and work experiences across full-stack development, AI Engineering, and quantitative
              finance to supplement my skills.
            </p>
            <p>Thanks for stopping by &#128075;</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <script type="module" src="/scripts/homeEffects.js"></script>
    </GlobalShell>
  </body>
</html>
